      children: "This substitutability is crucial for iterating on prompt systems. You can experiment with different prompting strategies, different models, or entirely different approaches (retrieval-based versus generative, for example) without rewriting your entire system. Each component advertises its contract clearly, and as long as new implementations honor that contract, they're drop-in replacements. This also simplifies testing: you can create mock implementations that return deterministic results for testing downstream components in isolation."
