      children: "These patterns work together synergistically. The prompt registry provides version control and documentation. The chain-of-responsibility pattern enables composing complex behaviors from simple components. The adapter pattern isolates model-specific details. Combined, they create a layered architecture where business logic, prompt design, and LLM integration are cleanly separated. This separation enables independent evolution: improve prompts without changing code, swap models without rewriting prompts, modify business logic without touching LLM integration."
    }), "\n", "\n", _jsx(_components.h2, {
